--- !u!1001 &1986609001
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 5104073181026472674, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: NPC_Ambientalin
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: radioDeteccion
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: cooldownReaparicion
      value: 9999999
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[0].texto
      value: "Prep\xE1rate, porque respirar en este\n sector se vuelve cada vez\n
        m\xE1s dif\xEDcil."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[1].texto
      value: "Tienes raz\xF3n... el olor es insoportable.\n Siento una mezcla entre
        basura\n descompuesta y agua estancada."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[2].texto
      value: "Es la combinaci\xF3n del deterioro\n del suelo y la contaminaci\xF3n\n
        del aire. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[3].texto
      value: "Toda esa basura acumulada\n se mezcla con vertimientos\n de aguas residuales
        y negras,\n haciendo que la tierra absorba\n sustancias nocivas\n y pierda
        su capacidad natural."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[4].texto
      value: "\xBFDe ah\xED vienen esos\n malos olores tan fuertes?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[5].texto
      value: "As\xED es. Al descomponerse los\n desechos al sol y filtrarse\n en
        el terreno, se liberan\n gases putrefactos que da\xF1an\n el aire de la zona.\n "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[6].texto
      value: "La gente vive respirando\n ese ambiente degradado\n todos los d\xEDas.\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[7].texto
      value: "El da\xF1o ya no est\xE1 solo\n en la superficie, est\xE1 \nen la tierra
        misma y en\n el aire que nos rodea. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[3].esJugador
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[4].esJugador
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[5].esJugador
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5415706260632634918, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogos.Array.data[7].esJugador
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6385244151009648185, guid: fbe5dc7bb912fbb4189bfbf716073ae1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AdditionalShaderChannelsFlag
      value: 25
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
